  "historyNote": "#4983, eff 11-16-90; moved by #5752, eff 12-2-93 (formerly Saf-C 2602); ss by #6459, eff 2-20-97; ss by #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
