  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c2600.html",
  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2607.01 Promotion of Permissible Firework Sales",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2607.01 Promotion of Permissible Firework Sales.\n\n(a) Buildings shall be used solely for the sale and storage of permissible fireworks and the items that promote such sales.\n\n(b) Items that promote the sale of permissible fireworks shall have the following visibly and permanently affixed to the item itself or its packaging:\n\n(1) Licensee’s name; and\n\n(2) A minimum of one of the following types of contact information for the licensee:\n\na. Address;\n\nb. Telephone number; or\n\nc. E-mail address or web site URL.\n\n(c) Items for sale or giveaway to consumers that promote the sale of permissible fireworks shall not be placed in a position in the retail sales floor area to contribute to a rapid spread of fire across the retail store containing fireworks.\n\nSource. #4983, eff 11-16-90; moved by #5752, eff 12-2-93 (formerly Saf-C 2602); ss by #6459, eff 2-20-97; ss by #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c2600.html"
